    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/5b496540fd289bb6da6a617e0a9bdb31.avif?t=1755797407\" data-has-big width=800 height=105 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/ec6ca54ca578572b1da1ee6e0f241963.avif?t=1755797407\" data-has-big width=800 height=287 /></span><strong>You are not lost in a village. You are lost in your own mind.</strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/1913f015bc1e1589a7e8e6d3aadb709e.poster.avif?t=1755797407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/1913f015bc1e1589a7e8e6d3aadb709e.webm?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/1913f015bc1e1589a7e8e6d3aadb709e.mp4?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Trapped in a forgotten village while searching for your missing wife, you uncover echoes of a life that never truly existed. Unravel haunting memories, piece together cryptic notes, and survive the unraveling of a fractured mind in this atmospheric psychological horror experience.      <br>       <br> <strong>Immerse yourself in hauntingly atmospheric chapters. </strong>   <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/734629b9c0a041922c1e056446cb9d58.poster.avif?t=1755797407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/734629b9c0a041922c1e056446cb9d58.webm?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/734629b9c0a041922c1e056446cb9d58.mp4?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore three meticulously designed chapters, each unraveling a deeper layer of Ethan\u2019s fractured mind. From the twisted gravity of Upside Down, to the eerie repetition of Death Cycle, every puzzle challenges not just your logic but your grip on reality. <br><br><br><strong>Will you be able to overcome the perfectly crafted Upside Down and Death Cycle puzzles? </strong><br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/2624bf4acb3b1c22f59f00ca85fec6cc.poster.avif?t=1755797407\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/2624bf4acb3b1c22f59f00ca85fec6cc.webm?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/2624bf4acb3b1c22f59f00ca85fec6cc.mp4?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It's a memory unraveling. From cryptic notes to environmental illusions, every solution pulls you deeper into Ethan\u2019s fractured psyche. Designed to confuse, disturb, and reveal, these puzzles are not just obstacles. They are part of the story you were never meant to remember. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/5b496540fd289bb6da6a617e0a9bdb31.avif?t=1755797407\" data-has-big width=800 height=105 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/ec6ca54ca578572b1da1ee6e0f241963.avif?t=1755797407\" data-has-big width=800 height=287 /></span><strong>You are not lost in a village. You are lost in your own mind.</strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/1913f015bc1e1589a7e8e6d3aadb709e.poster.avif?t=1755797407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/1913f015bc1e1589a7e8e6d3aadb709e.webm?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/1913f015bc1e1589a7e8e6d3aadb709e.mp4?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Trapped in a forgotten village while searching for your missing wife, you uncover echoes of a life that never truly existed. Unravel haunting memories, piece together cryptic notes, and survive the unraveling of a fractured mind in this atmospheric psychological horror experience.      <br>       <br> <strong>Immerse yourself in hauntingly atmospheric chapters. </strong>   <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/734629b9c0a041922c1e056446cb9d58.poster.avif?t=1755797407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/734629b9c0a041922c1e056446cb9d58.webm?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/734629b9c0a041922c1e056446cb9d58.mp4?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore three meticulously designed chapters, each unraveling a deeper layer of Ethan\u2019s fractured mind. From the twisted gravity of Upside Down, to the eerie repetition of Death Cycle, every puzzle challenges not just your logic but your grip on reality. <br><br><br><strong>Will you be able to overcome the perfectly crafted Upside Down and Death Cycle puzzles? </strong><br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/2624bf4acb3b1c22f59f00ca85fec6cc.poster.avif?t=1755797407\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/2624bf4acb3b1c22f59f00ca85fec6cc.webm?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850620/extras/2624bf4acb3b1c22f59f00ca85fec6cc.mp4?t=1755797407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It's a memory unraveling. From cryptic notes to environmental illusions, every solution pulls you deeper into Ethan\u2019s fractured psyche. Designed to confuse, disturb, and reveal, these puzzles are not just obstacles. They are part of the story you were never meant to remember. </p>",
